8
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:10,221
Think about it.

9
00:00:10,712 --> 00:00:12,106
They locked the winning

10
00:00:12,106 --> 00:00:13,102
car away in the

11
00:00:13,102 --> 00:00:13,500
garage.

12
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:14,787
This is the story

13
00:00:14,787 --> 00:00:16,216
of F1's banned tricks.

14
00:00:16,216 --> 00:00:18,031
Six ideas so clever,

15
00:00:18,031 --> 00:00:19,567
the sport had to

16
00:00:19,567 --> 00:00:20,253
