17
00:00:20,253 --> 00:00:22,073
And the last twist?

18
00:00:22,073 --> 00:00:23,552
It's now in the

19
00:00:23,552 --> 00:00:24,251
rulebook.

20
00:00:24,881 --> 00:00:25,436
Sweden,

21
00:00:25,436 --> 00:00:25,852
1978.

22
00:00:25,852 --> 00:00:27,779
Brabham's designer,

23
00:00:27,779 --> 00:00:28,889
Gordon Murray,

24
00:00:28,889 --> 00:00:30,839
put a giant fan

25
00:00:30,839 --> 00:00:32,157
