41
00:00:49,851 --> 00:00:50,051
it.

42
00:00:50,081 --> 00:00:51,902
Rival teams were furious.

43
00:00:51,902 --> 00:00:53,282
Brabham's boss,

44
00:00:53,282 --> 00:00:54,573
Bernie Ecclestone,

45
00:00:54,573 --> 00:00:56,083
