48
00:00:59,549 --> 00:01:01,102
The win still stands.

49
00:01:01,732 --> 00:01:03,010
Two years earlier,

50
00:01:03,010 --> 00:01:05,421
Tyrrell tried something even

51
00:01:05,421 --> 00:01:06,773
