52
00:01:06,773 --> 00:01:08,115
A car with six

53
00:01:08,115 --> 00:01:08,602
wheels.

54
00:01:08,632 --> 00:01:10,292
Four tiny front wheels

55
00:01:10,292 --> 00:01:11,980
