59
00:01:14,232 --> 00:01:15,730
But small tyres grip

60
00:01:15,730 --> 00:01:16,089
less.

61
00:01:16,089 --> 00:01:17,704
So they used two

62
00:01:17,704 --> 00:01:19,202
