65
00:01:21,173 --> 00:01:23,294
In Sweden in 1976,

66
00:01:23,492 --> 00:01:25,090
Tyrrell finished first and

67
00:01:25,090 --> 00:01:25,502
second.

68
00:01:25,532 --> 00:01:26,832
It's still the only

69
00:01:26,832 --> 00:01:28,567
