93
00:02:00,206 --> 00:02:01,626
of the season.

94
00:02:01,626 --> 00:02:02,155
Even so,

95
00:02:02,155 --> 00:02:04,004
Renault won both championships.

96
00:02:04,634 --> 00:02:05,018
2010.

97
00:02:05,018 --> 00:02:07,686
McLaren arrived with something

98
00:02:07,686 --> 00:02:09,349
rivals couldn't see at

99
00:02:09,349 --> 00:02:09,797
first.

100
00:02:09,797 --> 00:02:11,856
They called it the

101
00:02:11,856 --> 00:02:12,304
