The reported price?

133
00:02:53,983 --> 00:02:54,675
One pound.

134
00:02:54,705 --> 00:02:56,051
Hidden in its car

135
00:02:56,051 --> 00:02:57,285
was a loophole: a

136
00:02:57,285 --> 00:02:58,653
