145
00:03:11,005 --> 00:03:12,043
That November,

146
00:03:12,043 --> 00:03:13,737
Mercedes bought most of

147
00:03:13,737 --> 00:03:13,958
it.

148
00:03:13,958 --> 00:03:16,231
The one-pound team became

149
00:03:16,231 --> 00:03:16,785
Mercedes,

150
00:03:16,785 --> 00:03:18,914
